            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng The Local",
            "review_text": "Yvonne W\n4 contributions\n0\nThe Local Nha Trang\nDec 2025 • Family\nWe visited this restaurant for a family dinner, but unfortunately the experience was not enjoyable. One of the staff members was very impatient when we asked for explanations and recommendations. The interaction felt unfriendly, with an angry tone, and eventually another staff member had to step in to take our order.\n\nThe only positive point is the strategic location. The seafood itself was fresh, but personally, we found the dishes rather tasteless.\n\nOverall, the service and food did not meet our expectations, and we will not be visiting again.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
