            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng The Local",
            "review_text": "FrolovaOlya\nMoscow, Russia11 contributions\n0\nBeautiful place!\nMay 2024 • Family\nOne of our favorite restaurants in Nha Trang. Lived near and went here for lunch and dinner with two kids. The kitchen is amazing, everything is fresh, the cooking is delicious, the portions are good. Cocktails are beyond praise, and mojitos are, in truth, probably the best in all of Nha Trang. The kids try very hard, they tell you from the menu, they can cook something at their personal request, for example, for the kids. The atmosphere is always very cool here, by evening tables are never empty! In general, we sincerely recommend! And we'll definitely be back here next time!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten June 28, 2024",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
